Description: One package manager to rule them all
 PikaOS v2 package manager. Supports APT and Flatpak natively, plus Arch,
 Fedora, Alpine and podman-based containers (pikman enter), without depending
 on any PikaOS upstream repository.
 .
 This build is compiled for x86-64-v2 (GOAMD64=v2) so it runs on Sandy and
 Ivy Bridge hardware such as the Core i5-3550.